            <path d="M 530,95 L 548,88 L 568,82 L 590,78 L 615,72 L 642,68 L 670,62 L 700,58 L 732,55 L 765,52 L 800,50 L 838,48 L 875,50 L 910,52 L 942,55 L 970,60 L 995,65 L 1015,72 L 1035,80 L 1050,90 L 1060,102 L 1065,115 L 1062,128 L 1055,140 L 1045,148 L 1032,155 L 1018,158 L 1002,155 L 988,150 L 972,148 L 955,150 L 938,155 L 920,158 L 902,160 L 885,158 L 868,155 L 852,150 L 835,148 L 818,150 L 800,155 L 782,158 L 765,155 L 748,150 L 732,148 L 718,152 L 705,158 L 692,162 L 678,160 L 665,155 L 650,152 L 638,155 L 625,162 L 612,168 L 600,165 L 588,158 L 575,150 L 565,142 L 555,132 L 548,122 L 542,112 L 535,102 Z" class="trade-continent" />

